c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSA1Xnm1uU6BGAQz5Gz7lFV91g4ke4KWkCdYK_5miTh2A&oe=6B06FF03"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1057237765993092", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031554_1057237769326425_2363224287171852583_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1MiNeMKh0ZUQ7kNvwFDTo7l&_nc_oc=AdokGF3KxO3iQ1lHOPGu52th0RAgBS-hs5Z7cFoHR824VpJm3NCkFu81NrlNKAez3-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSvd1iRAWZRozWRrjCdnywakXdrd28u1NLh4u9ROaZG0Q&oe=6B070C26"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1488377815132033", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001670_1488377818465366_4369730771137685134_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eDIFMUs8cyIQ7kNvwE-GFDk&_nc_oc=Adoi8OOd7oWFxcptxlZCjHfZDInIgykoK_41JLWQa5FYY5AkO6LQtc-EKzKOWVBmOUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0eYI2vavjgFUnJWnCjCZSw1-WCOJyw1jtLwKS4HPU8Q&oe=6B070884"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "414882827722865", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982480_414882831056198_2207792374391745331_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IFHCDF8by0YQ7kNvwE4UPrq&_nc_oc=Adq-xpqfY1Z6O6lrth6iz0usrzPlQKSCubXWr9kLNvMU8yZ8Bo3_VYKRuxEfi2Yd9xc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSa10SHYc7-e_VR-5_q1pmJIgOCf1okOtQjaj6YKT27Eg&oe=6B06FBBD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16x9-2.png", "id": "811607170639171", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86609236_811607173972504_8101196321901847264_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4vcax8KJCiEQ7kNvwFkyE6d&_nc_oc=AdoXAGQs-vhVSNCUnvqfjrkwAq223VhGLIdsGdYwYZKif1t1UUSYylBqXh_2NN0lVSQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQKHQ0bpMbMgujEjXmKwtmpzxY3P-5Wb2VNCUddJjGekg&oe=6B06F081"}, "display_name": "Void Ninja Demo", "keywords": ["action", "platformer", "ninja", "void", "runner"], "long_description": "Void Ninja is an **action platformer** game that blends runner elements with a unique **\u201cJinba Ittai\u201d locomotion**.  \n\n\ud83d\udc49Gameplay: You're **always on the move and can't stop**. Use your hips and shoulders to steer on the path. Overcome obstacles and clear out enemies.   \n\n\ud83d\udc49**Just one button \u2014 let your body do the rest!*** \nYou don't need to remember million of combinations, or press something to move  - run with the flow.  \n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77  \n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Unique natural flow locomotion:**   \nInspired by the \"Jinba Ittai\" philosophy, this system ensures perfect unity between player and the game - you simply act as you would in real life  \n\u2796  \n- **Comfort / Motion sickness tested:**  \n 85% of players experienced no symptoms, 10% adapted after 30 minutes, and 5% did not adjust and we prefer not to talk about them  \n\u2796 \n- **Platformer / runner:**   \nFirst-person platforming adventure inspired by a certain blue hedgehog. Intense combats,  adrenaline-pumping jumps and jet-powered flights - this game will keep your heart racing   \n \u2796 \n- **Combat dance:**   \nAs you progress, you'll develop your own unique moves and combos crafted by your skill, not pre-made by the developers  \n \u2796\n- **Level reassembly:**   \nEach time you load a level, it\u2019s generated in a new and unique way   \n\n\n\n\ud83e\udea7**4 demo levels**   \n\u279517 extra levesl available in the paid supporter version\n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77 \n\nThis is work in progress version.\n**Share your thoughts, ideas and feedback with us** - let's make the game together.\n\n*rarely its 2 buttons, but you won't confuse them. Only 1 sounds better, right?\n", "short_description": "Action platformer with gesture based controls and unique locomotion."}]}, "developer_name": "Roman 